      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed, we need this large table to map each setup cellular connection error cause which is sent from modem. In 1.0 DataCallFailCause, we didn\u0027t have enough failed causes, lots of error causes exposed to unspecific error or oem failed cause to framework/app. Framework/App want to know the precise failed reason for each setup connection failure. Besides, I have added comment for each error cause, it should be easy to know the detailed reason for each error cause.",
